{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o020a","title":"诏二十功臣配祀太祖庙庭","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o020a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"诏曹真、曹休等二十位故臣配祀太祖庙庭。","evidence":["shaodi-e-o020a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":243,"label":"秋七月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y243","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o018","basis":"秋七月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o020a-q","shaodi-q-o018","shaodi-q-b-1f82bc956ef2b05c2fd6"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o020a-q","source_order":[4,77,"O020a"],"order":1015}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o020a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-fd5fa6caa10793fbca36","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，诏祀故大司马曹真、曹休，征南大将军夏侯尚，太常桓阶，司空陈群，太傅钟繇，车骑将军张郃，（左）〔右〕将军徐晃，前将军张辽，右将军乐进，太尉华歆，司徒王朗，骠骑将军曹洪，征西将军夏侯渊，后将军朱灵、文聘，执金吾臧霸，破虏将军李典，立义将军庞德，武猛校尉典韦于太祖庙庭〖11〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-1f82bc956ef2b05c2fd6","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-1f82bc956ef2b05c2fd6","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗四年：正始四年（公元243）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":89,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-de40b5693d22ad649e35","start":0,"end":18},{"id":"shaodi-q-o018","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-506c43889efc5c34fe4a","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖6〗，帝加元服〖7〗。赐群臣各有差。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
